{"ticker":"LNT","updated":"2026-10-30T22:57:05Z","profile":{"longName":"Alliant Energy Corporation","shortName":"Alliant Energy Corporation","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.alliantenergy.com","fullTimeEmployees":2948,"marketCap":18577750016,"trailingPE":22.674051,"forwardPE":19.495378,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.1945696,"pegRatio":2.17,"targetMeanPrice":74.88462,"targetHighPrice":83.0,"targetLowPrice":66.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":13,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.01,"earningsGrowth":-0.04,"grossMargins":0.44502,"operatingMargins":0.19053,"profitMargins":0.18447,"totalRevenue":4429000192,"beta":0.515,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":78.81,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":62.54,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.03},"summary":"Alliant Energy Corporation operates as a utility holding company that provides regulated electric and natural gas services in the United States. It operates through IPL and WPL segments. The company's IPL segment engages primarily in the generation and distribution of electricity and the distribution and transportation of natural gas to retail customers in select markets in Iowa. This segment also sells electricity to wholesale customers in Minnesota, Illinois and Iowa; and generates and distributes steam for two customers in Cedar Rapids, Iowa. Its WPL segment generates and distributes electricity, and distributes and transports natural gas to retail customers in select markets in Wisconsin; and sells electricity to wholesale customers in Wisconsin. It serves retail customers in the farming, agriculture, industrial manufacturing, chemical, packaging, and food industries, as well as wholesale customers comprising municipalities and rural electric cooperatives. In addition, the company owns and operates a short-line rail freight service in Iowa; a Mississippi River barge, rail, and truck freight terminal in Illinois; freight brokerage services; wind turbine blade recycling services; and a rail-served warehouse in Iowa. Further, it holds interests in a natural gas-fired electric generating unit near Sheboygan Falls, Wisconsin; and a wind farm located in Oklahoma. The company was ","summary_zh":"Alliant Energy Corporation 作為公用事業控股公司經營，在美國提供受監管的電力和天然氣服務。它透過 IPL 和 WPL 部分運作。該公司的 IPL 部門主要從事發電和配電以及向愛荷華州特定市場的零售客戶分銷和運輸天然氣。該部門也向明尼蘇達州、伊利諾伊州和愛荷華州的批發客戶出售電力；為愛荷華州錫達拉皮茲的兩家客戶生產和分配蒸汽。其 WPL 部門為威斯康辛州特定市場的零售客戶生產和配送電力、配送和運輸天然氣；並向威斯康辛州的批發客戶出售電力。它為農業、工業製造、化學、包裝和食品行業的零售客戶以及包括市政和農村電力合作社的批發客戶提供服務。此外，該公司在愛荷華州擁有並經營短線鐵路貨運服務；伊利諾伊州的密西西比河駁船、鐵路和卡車貨運碼頭；貨運經紀服務；風力渦輪機葉片回收服務；以及愛荷華州的一個鐵路服務倉庫。此外，它還擁有威斯康辛州希博伊根瀑布附近的天然氣發電機組的權益；以及位於俄克拉荷馬州的一個風電場。該公司是","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":64.66,"h":65.02,"l":64.38,"c":64.66,"v":1701400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":64.44,"h":64.83,"l":64.17,"c":64.52,"v":1600800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":64.85,"h":65.14,"l":64.31,"c":64.72,"v":2086400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":64.92,"h":64.99,"l":64.21,"c":64.62,"v":1609200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":64.68,"h":64.72,"l":63.7,"c":64.05,"v":1911800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":63.78,"h":64.24,"l":63.62,"c":64.01,"v":1656300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":64.01,"h":64.35,"l":63.74,"c":63.99,"v":1612700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":63.96,"h":64.78,"l":63.75,"c":64.66,"v":1588800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":64.44,"h":65.04,"l":64.44,"c":64.86,"v":1127300},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":64.86,"h":65.04,"l":64.69,"c":64.73,"v":862100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":64.54,"h":64.67,"l":63.54,"c":63.62,"v":1632500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":63.99,"h":64.43,"l":63.78,"c":63.86,"v":1944700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":63.67,"h":64.15,"l":63.28,"c":63.78,"v":1143400},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":63.96,"h":64.48,"l":63.5,"c":64.17,"v":2539600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":64.16,"h":64.37,"l":63.7,"c":64.22,"v":1340400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":64.08,"h":64.89,"l":63.98,"c":64.84,"v":1510300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":64.99,"h":65.54,"l":64.73,"c":65.47,"v":2023700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":65.47,"h":65.94,"l":65.07,"c":65