QN292dHhLeGlpWHdwZkJkem1zaXBaUC0wc2dKc0oxUVhwb1R0Ums5VmRncGhUMXlCRXVPT1p0LXktN2ROLVNVdkNTLVpZWTVhMFVKOFJFckRYMUkzUnpvQlR2MHpnTW14eVhrMTdKYkhLWF9OU2tfeW1pYlVjcUIwb1E0azJZcDlZUWUwSGwxY3Rsd3AzRTZERzFBaUQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"Alliant Energy 第三季財報電話會議亮點"}],"themes":[{"name":"能源/電力","count":20},{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"資料中心","count":2},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/352541/000035254126000007/lnt-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Alliant Energy maintains its principal executive offices in Madison, Wisconsin. Alliant Energy operates as a regulated investor-owned public utility holding company, and its purpose-driven strategy is to serve its customers and build stronger communities. Alliant Energy's primary focus is to provide regulated electric and natural gas service to approximately 1,010,000 electric and approximately 435,000 natural gas customers in the Midwest through its two public utility subsidiaries, IPL and WPL. The primary first tier wholly-owned subsidiaries of Alliant Energy are as follows:","zh":"Alliant Energy 的主要執行辦公室位於威斯康辛州麥迪遜市。 Alliant Energy 作為一家受監管的投資者擁有的公用事業控股公司運營，其目標驅動策略是服務客戶並建立更強大的社區。 Alliant Energy 的主要重點是透過其兩家公用事業子公司 IPL 和 WPL 為中西部約 1,010,000 名電力客戶和約 435,000 名天然氣客戶提供受監管的電力和天然氣服務。 Alliant Energy主要一級全資子公司如下："},{"en":"1) IPL - is a public utility engaged principally in the generation and distribution of electricity and the distribution and transportation of natural gas to retail customers in select markets in Iowa. IPL provides utility services to incorporated communities as directed by the IUC and utilizes non-exclusive franchises, which cover the use of public right-of-ways for utility facilities in incorporated communities for a maximum term of 25 years. At December 31, 2025, IPL supplied electric and natural gas service to approximately 505,000 and 230,000 retail customers, respectively, in Iowa. IPL also sells electricity to wholesale customers in Illinois and Iowa and was engaged in the generation and distribution of steam for two customers in Cedar Rapids, Iowa, which were each under contract through 2025 for taking minimum quantities of annual steam usage, with certain conditions. Subsequent t","zh":"1) IPL - 是一家公用事業公司，主要從事發電和配電以及向愛荷華州特定市場的零售客戶分配和運輸天然氣。 IPL 依照 IUC 的指示為合併社區提供公用事業服務，並利用非獨家特許經營權，其中涵蓋合併社區公用設施公共通行權的使用期限，最長期限為 25 年。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，IPL 分別為愛荷華州約 505,000 名和 230,000 名零售客戶提供電力和天然氣服務。 IPL 還向伊利諾伊州和愛荷華州的批發客戶銷售電力，並為愛荷華州錫達拉皮茲的兩家客戶生產和分配蒸汽，這兩家客戶均簽訂了到 2025 年的合同，在一定條件下獲取最低年度蒸汽使用量。隨後的t"},{"en":"2) WPL - is a public utility engaged principally in the generation and distribution of electricity and the distribution and transportation of natural gas to retail customers in select markets in Wisconsin. WPL operates in municipalities pursuant to permits of indefinite duration and state statutes authorizing utility operation in areas annexed by a municipality. At December 31, 2025, WPL supplied electric and natural gas service to approximately 505,000 and 205,000 retail customers, respectively. WPL also sells electricity to wholesale customers in Wisconsin.","zh":"2) WPL - 是一家公用事業公司，主要從事發電和配電以及向威斯康辛州特定市場的零售客戶分配和運輸天然氣。 WPL 根據無限期許可證和授權在市轄區所屬地區進行公用事業運營的州法規在市鎮開展業務。截至2025年12月31日，WPL分別向約505,000名和205,000名零售客戶提供電力和天然氣服務。 WPL 也向威斯康辛州的批發客戶出售電力。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"IUC - IPL is subject to regulation by the IUC for various matters including, but not limited to, retail utility rates and standards of service, accounting requirements, the construction of EGUs, and the acquisition, sale or lease of assets with values that exceed 3% of IPL's revenues. In Iowa, counties and cities are prohibited from regulating the sale of natural gas and propane, which supports IPL's ability to provide gas utility service to retail customers and industries.","zh":"IUC - IPL 在各種事項上受到 IUC 的監管，包括但不限於零售公用事業費率和服務標準、會計要求、EGU 的建設以及價值超過 IPL 收入 3% 的資產的收購、出售或租賃。在愛荷華州，縣和市被禁止監管天然氣和丙烷的銷售，這支持了 IPL 向零售客戶和行業提供天然氣公用事業服務的能力。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electric","val":3697000000,"zh":"電的"},{"name":"Ipl","val":2208000000,"zh":"脈衝光"},{"name":"Wpl","val":2065000000,"zh":"工作小組"},{"name":"Gas","val":525000000,"zh":"氣體"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":89000000,"zh":"所有其他部門"},{"name":"Other Utility","val":51000000,"zh":"其他實用程式"}],"total":4362000000}},"peers":["WEC","CMS","PNW","AEE","NI"]}}